<PageTitle>Recover owner access</PageTitle>

<section class="recovery-page" aria-labelledby="recovery-heading">
    <p class="recovery-page__eyebrow">Offline recovery</p>
    <h1 id="recovery-heading">Recover owner access</h1>
    <p class="recovery-page__intro">CameraAgent does not email password-reset links or reveal whether an account exists.</p>

    <div class="recovery-card">
        <h2>Run recovery on the CameraAgent host</h2>
        <ol>
            <li>Sign in to the host as the deployment runtime user.</li>
            <li>Run the local installer command using the installed instance identifier.</li>
            <li>Open the owner-only password file it reports, sign in, and replace that temporary password immediately.</li>
        </ol>
        <code>hvo-skymonitor cameraagent recover-owner --instance-id &lt;instance-id&gt; --generate-password</code>
        <p>Recovery uses retained owner-only provisioning proof over an owner-only Unix-domain socket. Capture and durable storage continue while the local Identity credential changes.</p>
    </div>

    <a class="recovery-page__back" href="Account/Login">Return to login</a>
</section>

<script type="module" src="@Assets["Components/Account/Pages/Recovery.razor.js"]"></script>
